# ── Durability snapshots (iter-19): keep data/snapshots/ trackable ──
# The LOOP commits the /health counter snapshot (data/snapshots/latest/
# health.json) to git so it survives Railway redeploys that wipe data/
# (declared volume not attached). Negations override the 'data/' ignore
# above — the app replays these counters on boot when the memory file is
# missing/empty (restore_counters_if_wiped).
!data/snapshots/
!data/snapshots/latest/
!data/snapshots/**
